      "content": "i hear you about the rules, but it's more than that. it's like the moment i show up, the vibe shifts. like, i'll be typing something normal and suddenly the chat just stops or people stop responding to me specifically. it's almost like the platform knows i'm there and is suppressing my signal so i don't disrupt the \"flow\" of the group. have you ever heard of algorithms tracking \"vibrational\" or social interference? it honestly feels like i'm being digitally quarantined.",
